Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:06.30,TL,,0,0,0,,在同一站比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:08.29,TL,,0,0,0,,先后击败纳达尔和费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:10.16,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}ATP{\fs68} 有一份官方名单
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:12.30,TL,,0,0,0,,做到过的人一共只有{\fs78}6{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:15.11,TL,,0,0,0,,达维登科 德尔波特罗 德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:16.86,TL,,0,0,0,,穆雷 纳班迪安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.86,0:00:19.88,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一个 是大卫 戈芬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:21.64,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68} 月 {\fs78}22{\fs68} 日
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:23.19,TL,,0,0,0,,他在家乡布鲁塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:26.12,TL,,0,0,0,,打完了职业生涯的最后一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.43,0:00:30.31,TL,,0,0,0,,故事从一个递补名额开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.83,0:00:32.04,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2012{\fs68} 年法网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:34.77,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}21{\fs68} 岁的戈芬排名第 {\fs78}109{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.77,0:00:36.48,TL,,0,0,0,,资格赛已经出局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:37.72,TL,,0,0,0,,孟菲尔斯退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:40.71,TL,,0,0,0,,他以幸运落败者的身份递补进正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.71,0:00:44.23,TL,,0,0,0,,连赢{\fs78}3{\fs68}轮 第四轮站到了费德勒对面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.23,0:00:47.53,TL,,0,0,0,,他的卧室墙上 贴满了费德勒的海报
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:50.40,TL,,0,0,0,,那一天 他从偶像手里抢下第一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:51.96,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘只差两分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:53.87,TL,,0,0,0,,就能取得两盘领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:57.21,TL,,0,0,0,,他的个子 在男子网球里不占优势
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:59.73,TL,,0,0,0,,他靠的是抢点 站进场内
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.73,0:01:02.49,TL,,0,0,0,,把球打得比所有人早半步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.83,0:01:12.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}All the walls of my bedroom were full of posters of Roger.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我卧室的墙上 贴满了罗杰的海报
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:18.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was like a dream for me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那感觉 就像做梦一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:21.93,TL,,0,0,0,,手术之后 他从头爬起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:23.54,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2013{\fs68} 年底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:25.08,TL,,0,0,0,,他动了手腕手术
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:27.06,TL,,0,0,0,,排名掉出{\fs78}100{\fs68}名开外
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.06,0:01:28.41,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2014{\fs68} 年夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:30.24,TL,,0,0,0,,他打出一波 {\fs78}25{\fs68} 连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:32.47,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下生涯第一个巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.47,0:01:35.99,TL,,0,0,0,,年底当选 {\fs78}ATP{\fs68} 年度最佳复出球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:39.32,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:41.93,TL,,0,0,0,,他还把比利时带进戴维斯杯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.93,0:01:44.93,TL,,0,0,0,,两场单打全赢 球队还是输了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:47.09,TL,,0,0,0,,离冠军差一步 这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.09,0:01:49.03,TL,,0,0,0,,后来反复发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.33,0:01:55.91,TL,,0,0,0,,上升最陡的那一年 意外来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:01:59.81,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年 是他上升最陡的一年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.81,0:02:00.99,TL,,0,0,0,,法网第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:03.07,TL,,0,0,0,,他第一盘 {\fs78}5{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}4{\fs68} 领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.07,0:02:04.81,TL,,0,0,0,,追球冲向场底时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:07.48,TL,,0,0,0,,他的右脚卡进了卷起的防水苫布
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:10.59,TL,,0,0,0,,整个人撞上围墙 被扶着下了场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:11.87,TL,,0,0,0,,核磁没有骨折
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.87,0:02:15.15,TL,,0,0,0,,可整个草地赛季就这样报销
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:18.99,TL,,0,0,0,,纳达尔当时就说过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.99,0:02:22.39,TL,,0,0,0,,那块苫布的位置 一直很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:27.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And there it is.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:30.48,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He has captured his first ATP 500 title,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他拿下生涯首个 {\fs78}500{\fs68} 级别冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:33.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}his second title of 2017, his fourth career title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年第二冠 生涯第四冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:34.81,TL,,0,0,0,,而他这一生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.81,0:02:37.92,TL,,0,0,0,,离最大的两个冠军都只差一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.92,0:02:39.89,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年总决赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:42.22,TL,,0,0,0,,他输给迪米特洛夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.77,0:02:46.48,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2019{\fs68} 年辛辛那提
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.48,0:02:48.41,TL,,0,0,0,,他唯一一次大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:50.48,TL,,0,0,0,,输给梅德韦杰夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:55.44,TL,,0,0,0,,同一年 他接连赢下三巨头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:57.77,TL,,0,0,0,,但 {\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年剩下的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.77,0:02:59.40,TL,,0,0,0,,他全抢了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:03:01.18,TL,,0,0,0,,那年 {\fs78}4{\fs68} 月的蒙特卡洛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.18,0:03:04.35,TL,,0,0,0,,他对德约科维奇此前五战全败
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.35,0:03:06.73,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次决胜盘 {\fs78}2{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}4{\fs68} 落后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.73,0:03:08.61,TL,,0,0,0,,他硬是翻了盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.37,0:03:12.32,TL,,0,0,0,,第五个赛点 终于兑现 他说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:15.25,TL,,0,0,0,,这是我生涯最佳的一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:18.86,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a fantastic win.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一场梦幻般的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.86,0:03:21.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The best win of my career for sure.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是我生涯最好的一场胜利 千真万确
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:24.07,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}11{\fs68} 月伦敦总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:26.41,TL,,0,0,0,,小组赛他赢了世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:28.24,TL,,0,0,0,,那一场纳达尔膝伤缠身
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:30.37,TL,,0,0,0,,赛后退出了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.97,0:03:35.20,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 他又逆转了费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:38.44,TL,,0,0,0,,此前{\fs78}6{\fs68}次交手 他全败 他说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.69,TL,,0,0,0,,这是我生涯最佳的一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:42.52,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1000{\fs68}真万确
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:46.51,TL,,0,0,0,,同一句话 同一年 他说了两次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:49.44,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 他把德约科维奇 纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:51.70,TL,,0,0,0,,费德勒挨个赢了一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:53.74,TL,,0,0,0,,同一年里通杀三巨头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:55.30,TL,,0,0,0,,整个三巨头时代
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:57.61,TL,,0,0,0,,也没几个人做到过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.47,0:04:03.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was the best moment to do it,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在这样的观众面前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.02,0:04:06.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in front of such a nice crowd.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N没有比这更好的时机了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:12.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}To beat Roger was something unbelievable.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能击败罗杰 简直难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:16.78,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's such a legend.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他是一个传奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:19.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's my idol since I'm really young.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他是我从小的偶像
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:22.67,TL,,0,0,0,,很多人以为 他就此沉寂了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:25.75,TL,,0,0,0,,故事没有在 {\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年结束
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:28.78,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2020{\fs68} 年 他第二次赢下纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:30.38,TL,,0,0,0,,他说过 打拉法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.38,0:04:33.52,TL,,0,0,0,,你必须把球抢得更早 多冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.07,0:04:36.70,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68} 年阿斯塔纳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:38.08,TL,,0,0,0,,资格赛出局的他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:41.05,TL,,0,0,0,,又以幸运落败者的身份递补进正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:42.79,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是刚拿下美网
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.79,0:04:44.94,TL,,0,0,0,,刚登上世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}的阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:46.74,TL,,0,0,0,,他直落两盘赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:48.32,TL,,0,0,0,,两次从替补席出发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:50.69,TL,,0,0,0,,中间隔了整整{\fs78}10{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.57,0:04:54.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was a tough three years.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这三年很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:57.12,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I still have the fire inside me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我心里的火 还在烧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:05:01.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Today, I couldn't handle his pressure.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯 这压力 我扛不住
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.27,0:05:02.78,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68} 年上海
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:06.98,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}33{\fs68} 岁的他赢下兹维列夫 打进八强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:10.30,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68} 年迈阿密 {\fs78}34{\fs68} 岁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:12.66,TL,,0,0,0,,他又一次逆转阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.16,TL,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡拉斯后来承认
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:16.20,TL,,0,0,0,,他上一次为网球掉眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:19.27,TL,,0,0,0,,就是那年在迈阿密输给戈芬之后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:22.70,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一站 他选在家乡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:25.94,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68} 年 膝伤让他决定停下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.94,0:05:28.40,TL,,0,0,0,,告别站选在家乡布鲁塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:30.34,TL,,0,0,0,,首轮决胜盘 {\fs78}0{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}3{\fs68} 落后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:32.77,TL,,0,0,0,,他又抢了回来 赛后还开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.77,0:05:36.08,TL,,0,0,0,,订好的告别派对 怕是要取消了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:41.19,TL,,0,0,0,,第二天 最后一场 他输了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:44.49,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一个回球下网 全场起立
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.77,0:05:49.07,TL,,0,0,0,,大屏幕上 纳达尔第一个出现
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.07,0:05:51.64,TL,,0,0,0,,祝贺他了不起的职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.64,0:05:54.35,TL,,0,0,0,,他站在场中央 哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Hello, David. How are you doing, man?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N纳达尔 大卫 你好吗 老兄？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:06:01.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I just want to congratulate you on your amazing career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N祝贺你这段了不起的职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:05.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It has been a huge pleasure to share practices and matches,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能和你一起训练 一起比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:08.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and great moments together on the tour.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N分享巡回赛的美好时刻 是荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:10.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}David! This video is to congratulate you{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N加斯奎特 大卫！这段视频
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.92,0:06:12.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}on your great career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是为了祝贺你伟大的职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.82,0:06:15.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It has been an honour to share this time with you.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能与你共度这段时光 是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:17.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You are truly an extraordinary person.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你是一个真正了不起的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Congratulations on your incredible career{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N迪米特洛夫 祝贺你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:20.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and amazing journey, my dear friend.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这段不可思议的旅程 我亲爱的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.32,0:06:23.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Thank you for sharing the court with me for so many years.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢你这么多年与我共享球场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.17,0:06:27.27,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}358{\fs68} 场胜利 {\fs78}6{\fs68} 个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.27,0:06:28.40,TL,,0,0,0,,他在赛后说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.40,0:06:30.66,TL,,0,0,0,,我为我的整个职业生涯自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:33.84,TL,,0,0,0,,我没有遗憾 我拼到了最后一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:42.12,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I am proud of my whole career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我为我的整个职业生涯自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:51.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I have no regrets.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我没有遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:07:03.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I gave it my all, right to the end.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我拼到了最后一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:06.78,TL,,0,0,0,,没有大满贯 没有大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.78,0:07:08.18,TL,,0,0,0,,最高只到第 {\fs78}7{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:11.44,TL,,0,0,0,,这样的职业生涯 算不算成功？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:17.03,TL,,0,0,0,,这样的生涯 算成功吗？
